>>> E8a  CONTROL: does the offline bound work at all?
  All administrative calendars set to 24/7, so a rake's line
  occupancy no longer depends on WHEN it is placed. Durations are
  then schedule-independent and classical 1|r_j|SumC_j applies, so
  CP-SAT must be an genuine lower bound. If it is not, the
  machinery is broken rather than the assumption.
      FCFS mean wait   11.56 h
      COST mean wait   10.64 h
       CNP mean wait   11.38 h
     CPSAT mean wait   10.37 h
